            "description": "",
            "summary": "While President Donald Trump was meeting with Russian President Vladimir Putin in Alaska on Friday, a Ukrainian telecommunications company was making moves in New York.  Kyivstar Group  Ukraine\u2019s largest mobile operator, went public on the Nasdaq on Friday through a merger with a special purpose acquisition company, or SPAC.  It\u2019s already emerged as a trendy play for retail investors looking to bet on a peace deal between Russia and Ukraine.",
